    <li><strong style="color: var(--text);">Confusing AWST with AEST:</strong> AWST is UTC+8 (Perth), whereas AEST is UTC+10 (Sydney/Melbourne). Do not use Sydney time for Western Australia!</li>
    <li><strong style="color: var(--text);">Calendar Date Shift Mismatches:</strong> 10:00 AM AWST on Tuesday maps to 9:00 PM EST on <em>Monday evening</em>. Always verify the calendar date.</li>
